</button>
</div>
 
</div>


                <p class="text-muted">
                    The Where() query represents a sequence that is evaluated
                    when it is enumerated.
                </p>


                <!-- TO LIST -->

                <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-5 mb-3">
                    ToList()
                </h3>

                <p class="text-muted">
                    ToList() immediately materializes the query result into
                    a List.
                </p>


                <div class="try-it-example">
 
    <div class="code-block shadow-sm">
 
        <div class="code-lang-tag">
            C#
</div>
 
